  <div class="hero">
    <div class="category">Wireless &bull; ESP32</div>
    <h1>How to build an ESP-NOW remote<br>charger monitor with INA219<br>and OLED</h1>
    <div class="meta">
      <div class="meta-item"><strong>Board:</strong> ESP32 Dev Board (38-pin, both sender and receiver)</div>
      <div class="meta-item"><strong>Sensor:</strong> INA219 (I2C 0x40)</div>
      <div class="meta-item"><strong>Display:</strong> SSD1306 128x64 OLED (I2C 0x3C)</div>
      <div class="meta-item"><strong>Topic:</strong> ESP-NOW, unicast, INA219, wireless sensor data</div>
    </div>
